From: Agus Rachman <agus.rachman@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:52:25 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Engine support for UK citations

- Schema: court_ids may be two words (EWCA Civ, SC EDIN)
- parse_citation.py: two-word court identifiers; a division after the
  number is reported separately ([2025] EWHC 1383 (Admin)); report series
  cited without a volume ([2024] AC 1) or without brackets (2024 SLT 123)
  are matched against report_series; new --publishers option
- Pack schema guide documents the forms; one new script test

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MoX2CD8e32TheN9ftqzoZp
